%% POST /api/orders: how one request is integrated across the three systems.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant A as Integration API
    participant I as Inventory
    participant S as Sales
    participant D as Delivery
    C->>A: POST /api/orders (JSON + X-API-Key)
    A->>A: Check key and validate body
    A->>I: Price items and check stock
    I-->>A: Priced lines (or 404 / 409)
    A->>S: Charge payment
    S-->>A: Payment captured (or 402)
    A->>I: Reserve stock
    A->>S: Record order
    A->>D: Create pending delivery
    A-->>C: 201 Created (order + payment + delivery)
